OL,3,GNEWSAFirst World Cup win for transplant
OL,4,Afootball team
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngland's transplant football team are
OL,7,Fworld champions for the first time.
OL,9,FThey thrashed Spain 5-1 on Friday to
OL,10,Ftake the crown in Frankfurt, Germany,
OL,11,Ftaking revenge after the country
OL,12,Fknocked them out at the previous World
OL,13,FCup in 2024.
OL,15,FManager Daley Cross, from Bicester,
OL,16,FOxfordshire, said he could sense that
OL,17,Fhis team were determined to bring the
OL,18,Ftrophy home from the outset.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
