OL,3,GNEWSAFirst World Cup win for transplant
OL,4,Afootball team
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I could just see in their eyes that
OL,7,Fthey wanted it and they went onto that
OL,8,Fpitch and they delivered one hell of a
OL,9,Fperformance that I am immensely proud
OL,10,Fof," he said.
